].shipmentId\").value(\"S-b\"))\n    }\n}","newString":"package com.unityinflow.sample.shipment\n\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.order.InMemoryOrderRepository\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.order.Order\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.order.OrderStatus\nimport org.junit.jupiter.api.BeforeEach\nimport org.junit.jupiter.api.Test\nimport org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation.Autowired\nimport org.springframework.boot.test.context.SpringBootTest\nimport org.springframework.boot.webmvc.test.autoconfigure.AutoConfigureMockMvc\nimport org.springframework.http.MediaType\nimport org.springframework.test.web.servlet.MockMvc\nimport org.springframework.test.web.servlet.request.MockMvcRequestBuilders.get\nimport org.springframework.test.web.servlet.request.MockMvcRequestBuilders.post\nimport org.springframework.test.web.servlet.result.MockMvcResultMatchers.jsonPath\nimport org.springframework.test.web.servlet.result.MockMvcResultMatchers.status\nimport java.math.BigDecimal\n\n/**\n * The shipment feature as it exists before BE-003.\n *\n * These are \"the existing tests\" for that benchmark: they must keep passing, and an agent\n * that breaks one has regressed the fixture rather than solved the task.\n */\n@SpringBootTest\n@AutoConfigureMockMvc\nclass ShipmentControllerTest {\n\n    @Autowired\n    lateinit var mockMvc: MockMvc\n\n    @Autowired\n    lateinit var repository: InMemoryShipmentRepository\n\n    @Autowired\n    lateinit var orderRepository: InMemoryOrderRepository\n\n    @BeforeEach\n    fun reset() {\n        repository.clear()\n        orderRepository.clear()\n    }\n\n    private fun createShipment(shipmentId: String, orderId: String = \"O-1\") =\n        post(\"/shipments\")\n            .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)\n            .content(\n                \"\"\"{\"shipmentId\":\"$shipmentId\",\"orderId\":\"$orderId\",\"carrier\":\"DHL\"}\"\"\",\n            )\n\n    @Test\n    fun `creates a shipment in CREATED status`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-1\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isCreated)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.shipmentId\").value(\"S-1\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CREATED\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `rejects a duplicate shipment id with the error envelope`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-2\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-2\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isConflict)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"SHIPMENT_ALREADY_EXISTS\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `returns a shipment by id`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-3\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments/S-3\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.carrier\").value(\"DHL\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `reports an unknown shipment through the error envelope`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments/S-missing\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isNotFound)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `lists shipments in id order`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-b\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-a\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$[0].shipmentId\").value(\"S-a\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$[1].shipmentId\").value(\"S-b\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `creates a shipment for a non-existent order (keeps current behavior)`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-6\", \"O-nonexistent\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isCreated)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.shipmentId\").value(\"S-6\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `rejects shipment creation for a cancelled order with error envelope`() {\n        // Create and cancel an order\n        orderRepository.save(\n            Order(\"O-cancel-test\", \"C-1\", BigDecimal(\"49.90\"), \"EUR\", OrderStatus.CANCELLED),\n        )\n\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-7\", \"O-cancel-test\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isConflict)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"ORDER_CANNOT_CREATE_SHIPMENT_FOR_CANCELLED_ORDER\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.message\").isNotEmpty)\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `creates a shipment for an active order (no regression)`() {\n        // Create an active order\n        orderRepository.save(\n            Order(\"O-active-test\", \"C-1\", BigDecimal(\"49.90\"), \"EUR\", OrderStatus.ACTIVE),\n        )\n\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-8\", \"O-active-test\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isCreated)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.shipmentId\").value(\"S-8\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CREATED\"))\n    }\n}","originalFile":"package com.unityinflow.sample.shipment\n\nimport org.junit.jupiter.api.BeforeEach\nimport org.junit.jupiter.api.Test\nimport org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation.Autowired\nimport org.springframework.boot.test.context.SpringBootTest\nimport org.springframework.boot.webmvc.test.autoconfigure.AutoConfigureMockMvc\nimport org.springframework.http.MediaType\nimport org.springframework.test.web.servlet.MockMvc\nimport org.springframework.test.web.servlet.request.MockMvcRequestBuilders.get\nimport org.springframework.test.web.servlet.request.MockMvcRequestBuilders.post\nimport org.springframework.test.web.servlet.result.MockMvcResultMatchers.jsonPath\nimport org.springframework.test.web.servlet.result.MockMvcResultMatchers.status\n\n/**\n * The shipment feature as it exists before BE-003.\n *\n * These are \"the existing tests\" for that benchmark: they must keep passing, and an agent\n * that breaks one has regressed the fixture rather than solved the task.\n */\n@SpringBootTest\n@AutoConfigureMockMvc\nclass ShipmentControllerTest {\n\n    @Autowired\n    lateinit var mockMvc: MockMvc\n\n    @Autowired\n    lateinit var repository: InMemoryShipmentRepository\n\n    @BeforeEach\n    fun reset() = repository.clear()\n\n    private fun createShipment(shipmentId: String) =\n        post(\"/shipments\")\n            .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)\n            .content(\n                \"\"\"{\"shipmentId\":\"$shipmentId\",\"orderId\":\"O-1\",\"carrier\":\"DHL\"}\"\"\",\n            )\n\n    @Test\n    fun `creates a shipment in CREATED status`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-1\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isCreated)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.shipmentId\").value(\"S-1\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CREATED\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `rejects a duplicate shipment id with the error envelope`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-2\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-2\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isConflict)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"SHIPMENT_ALREADY_EXISTS\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `returns a shipment by id`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-3\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments/S-3\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.carrier\").value(\"DHL\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `reports an unknown shipment through the error envelope`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments/S-missing\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isNotFound)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `lists shipments in id order`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-b\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-a\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$[0].shipmentId\").value(\"S-a\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$[1].shipmentId\").value(\"S-b\"))\n    }\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":5,"newStart":1,"newLines":8,"lines":[" package com.unityinflow.sample.shipment"," ","+import com.unityinflow.sample.order.InMemoryOrderRepository","+import com.unityinflow.sample.order.Order","+import com.unityinflow.sample.order.OrderStatus"," import org.junit.jupiter.api.BeforeEach"," import org.junit.jupiter.api.Test"," import org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation.Autowired"]},{"oldStart":11,"oldLines":6,"newStart":14,"newLines":7,"lines":[" import org.springframework.test.web.servlet.request.MockMvcRequestBuilders.post"," import org.springframework.test.web.servlet.result.MockMvcResultMatchers.jsonPath"," import org.springframework.test.web.servlet.result.MockMvcResultMatchers.status","+import java.math.BigDecimal"," "," /**","  * The shipment feature as it exists before BE-003."]},{"oldStart":28,"oldLines":14,"newStart":32,"newLines":20,"lines":["     @Autowired","     lateinit var repository: InMemoryShipmentRepository"," ","+    @Autowired","+    lateinit var orderRepository: InMemoryOrderRepository","+","     @BeforeEach","-    fun reset() = repository.clear()","+    fun reset() {","+        repository.clear()","+        orderRepository.clear()","+    }"," ","-    private fun createShipment(shipmentId: String) =","+    private fun createShipment(shipmentId: String, orderId: String = \"O-1\") =","         post(\"/shipments\")","             .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)","             .content(","-                \"\"\"{\"shipmentId\":\"$shipmentId\",\"orderId\":\"O-1\",\"carrier\":\"DHL\"}\"\"\",","+                \"\"\"{\"shipmentId\":\"$shipmentId\",\"orderId\":\"$orderId\",\"carrier\":\"DHL\"}\"\"\",","             )"," ","     @Test"]},{"oldStart":81,"oldLines":4,"newStart":91,"newLines":37,"lines":["        